{"id":"ca5920196b4108bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-hecke-correspondence.md","title":"Hecke Correspondence","display":"thm-hecke-correspondence — Hecke Correspondence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hecke-correspondence","aliases":["58-thm-hecke-correspondence"],"display":"thm-hecke-correspondence — Hecke Correspondence","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-modular-curve.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hecke-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hecke-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hecke-correspondence — Hecke Correspondence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1616e874e8eb33c\" href=\"?note=e1616e874e8eb33c\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-modular-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-modular-curve.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md\">../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d50da078de7aa54\" href=\"?note=8d50da078de7aa54\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md\">../batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" href=\"?note=5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" title=\"58-df-operator\">58-df-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0(N)\">\\(X_0(N)\\)</span> (Hecke 模曲线)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(n,N)=1\">\\(\\gcd(n,N)=1\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq2\">\\(k\\geq2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> (normalized Hecke operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))\">\\(S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))\\)</span> (cusp forms of weight <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> and trivial nebentypus)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> (complex-linear endomorphisms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)\\)</span> (Hecke operator formula predicate, 本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}endomorphism}\\vdash N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\to T_n\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}(S_k(\\Gamma_0(N)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}endomorphism}\\vdash N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\to T_n\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}(S_k(\\Gamma_0(N)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)\\leftrightarrow N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\land f\\in S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))\\land z\\in\\mathbb H\\land (T_nf)(z)=n^{k-1}\\sum_{\\substack{ad=n\\\\a,d&gt;0}}d^{-k}\\sum_{b=0}^{d-1}f\\!\\left(\\frac{az+b}{d}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)\\leftrightarrow N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\land f\\in S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))\\land z\\in\\mathbb H\\land (T_nf)(z)=n^{k-1}\\sum_{\\substack{ad=n\\\\a,d&gt;0}}d^{-k}\\sum_{b=0}^{d-1}f\\!\\left(\\frac{az+b}{d}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For trivial nebentypus and indices prime to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>, these Hecke operators commute and are self-adjoint with respect to the Petersson inner product.</li>\n<li>Newforms are simultaneous eigenfunctions of all Hecke operators.</li>\n<li>Atkin–Lehner theory distinguishes oldforms from newforms.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-function of newform has Euler product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(f, s) = \\prod_p (1 - a_p p^{-s} + \\chi(p) p^{k-1-2s})^{-1}\">\\(L(f, s) = \\prod_p (1 - a_p p^{-s} + \\chi(p) p^{k-1-2s})^{-1}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-modular-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1616e874e8eb33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-modular-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md","status":"resolved","id":"a891b0f45131631a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"8d50da078de7aa54","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_0(N)","display":false},{"tex":"N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(n,N)=1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}endomorphism}\\vdash N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\to T_n\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}(S_k(\\Gamma_0(N)))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}formula}\\vdash \\operatorname{HeckeFormula}_S(T_n,f,z,N,n,k)\\leftrightarrow N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\land2\\leq k\\land\\gcd(n,N)=1\\land f\\in S_k(\\Gamma_0(N))\\land z\\in\\mathbb H\\land (T_nf)(z)=n^{k-1}\\sum_{\\substack{ad=n\\\\a,d>0}}d^{-k}\\sum_{b=0}^{d-1}f\\!\\left(\\frac{az+b}{d}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L(f, s) = \\prod_p (1 - a_p p^{-s} + \\chi(p) p^{k-1-2s})^{-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-hecke-correspondence.md|58-thm-hecke-correspondence]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["e1616e874e8eb33c","a891b0f45131631a","8d50da078de7aa54","5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed"]}